#: docwordcompletion.cpp:648
msgid "Automatically &show completion list"
msgstr "Tự động hiển thị danh sách hoàn chỉnh"

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:661
msgctxt ""
"Translators: This is the first part of two strings which will comprise the "
"sentence 'Show completions when a word is at least N characters'. The first "
"part is on the right side of the N, which is represented by a spinbox "
"widget, followed by the second part: 'characters long'. Characters is a "
"ingeger number between and including 1 and 30. Feel free to leave the second "
"part of the sentence blank if it suits your language better. "
msgid "Show completions &when a word is at least"
msgstr "&Hiển thị những cách hoàn chỉnh khi từ có ít nhất"

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:669
msgctxt ""
"This is the second part of two strings that will comprise the sentence 'Show "
"completions when a word is at least N characters'"
msgid "characters long."
msgstr "ký tự."

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:672
msgid ""
"Enable the automatic completion list popup as default. The popup can be "
"disabled on a view basis from the 'Tools' menu."
msgstr ""
"Hiệu lực danh sách hoàn chỉnh tự động là mặc định. Có thể vô hiệu hoá bộ bật "
"lên đựa vào khung xem, từ trình đơn « Công cụ »."

#: docwordcompletion.cpp:675
msgid ""
"Define the length a word should have before the completion list is displayed."
msgstr "Ghi rõ độ dài từ nên gây ra hiển thị danh sách cách hoàn chỉnh."

